lowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulus-allods/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulus-allods/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulus-allods/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulus-allods/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulus-allods/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulus-allods/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulus-allods/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulus-allods/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-20T01:03:43Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T01:03:43Z","body":"Hi thanks for your contribution, is this feature still planned ?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3770595304/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5158894948","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108720#issuecomment-5158894948","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108720","id":5158894948,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABM359ZA","user":{"login":"SK83RJOSH","id":1371787,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzE3ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1371787?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH","html_url":"https://github.com/SK83RJOSH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-02T15:32:08Z","updated_at":"2026-08-02T15:32:08Z","body":"Out of curiosity, what's currently blocking this? Further review?\r\n\r\nI use Godot to create tooling around older games, where partial mips were used frequently / with intent. I've been hoping to see this land for a while now, so I'm just curious if it's a matter of needing more eyes / hands / etc. :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5158894948/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5529631290","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108720#issuecomment-5529631290","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108720","id":5529631290,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSZd6Og","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T17:35:31Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T17:35:31Z","body":"> Out of curiosity, what's currently blocking this? Further review?\r\n> \r\n> I use Godot to create tooling around older games, where partial mips were used frequently / with intent. I've been hoping to see this land for a while now, so I'm just curious if it's a matter of needing more eyes / hands / etc. :)\r\n\r\nSadly, partial mipmaps are a pretty niche feature these days and there isn't a lot of user demand for it at the moment. Given that this change affects many parts of the engine's internals as well as the behavior of the commonly-used Image class, it's a risky feature to merge.\r\n\r\nInitially this pull request was made as a workaround for some other issues, but those have since been fixed by implementing more specific features (such as the mipmap alpha coverage being fixed by #104289)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5529631290/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5530137159","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108720#issuecomment-5530137159","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108720","id":5530137159,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSZ8yRw","user":{"login":"SK83RJOSH","id":1371787,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzE3ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1371787?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH","html_url":"https://github.com/SK83RJOSH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T18:16:11Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T18:16:34Z","body":"> Sadly, partial mipmaps are a pretty niche feature these days and there isn't a lot of user demand for it at the moment. Given that this change affects many parts of the engine's internals as well as the behavior of the commonly-used Image class, it's a risky feature to merge.\r\n\r\nFair enough, bit of a shame, for DDS with partial mips I've had to do some nasty workarounds. Plus I can't implement one to one preview for assets and such.\r\n\r\nThat said totally understandable, at this point it would indeed be a pretty big change and I doubt anyone is fine tuning mips like back in the day. :slightly_smiling_face: ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5530137159/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]